Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.61,0:00:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.61,0:00:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"Experiment Result: Human is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,mismatch."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Human is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...died?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so. Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it say after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The details are in Jellyman's report #143.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Jellyman's Report?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's a weird database on this server.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of program code, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.15,0:00:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Die! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We should stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:00:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've had an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.71,0:01:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"I was this close to getting it!" experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru, I've got canned fishcake stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.59,0:01:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Program code...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.13,0:01:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The IBN 5100 was created before BASIC,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,so it can read IBN's proprietary programming languages or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.43,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the IBN 5100's abilities to stop their plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk to you in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my email address.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you contact me, I'll answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:33.03,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\frz346\blur1.5\fs75\c&H171717&\alpha&56&\pos(777,417)}John Titor
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.57,0:01:33.03,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\frz346\pos(285,585)\blur1.125}There's something I want to ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:33.03,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\frz346\pos(285,585)\blur3\alpha&CA&}There's something I want to ask you
