Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Daru and I've been working all night
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and haven't been home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And everything Daru wears,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.89,0:03:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,from his T-shirts to his underwear, is XXXL.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I spy Okabe Rintaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I should warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,One, my name is Hououin Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.15,0:03:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, that greeting is dangero—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup, Suzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, when did you two meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We live in the same building.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, we'd at least know each other's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu gave me this Rai-Net card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To go do the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin and Daru have been up all night for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Part-timer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't do your job, I'll fire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.31,0:04:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off my part-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're the one in love, Mr. Braun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Say that when Nae's around. I dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll seriously kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nae?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.61,0:04:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The little woodland creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.11,0:04:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call my daughter a woodland creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I be in love with a little kid like her, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an adult and a warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I like that look, Part-Time Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Always remember that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,someday, you'll be able to change classes to a true warrior—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When you talk, it—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already a warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I get all the weirdos?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.11,0:05:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a habit of Mayuri's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken to calling it the "Stardust Handshake."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if I could reach the stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even see the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, even in the daytime, the stars are still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were powerful EM waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A cellular malfunction's a real possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I saw that banana.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The PhoneWave (name subject to change) is a time machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.53,0:05:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd this happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm closing the lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:06:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru is like the universe—constantly expanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining Finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Titor doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me to message him.
