Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:10.98,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(225,967.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.98,0:06:11.02,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(246,937.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:11.06,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(264,907.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:11.10,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(282,882)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:11.14,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(294,862.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:11.18,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(304.5,847.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:11.23,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(312,837)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:11.27,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(316.5,831)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.27,0:06:13.69,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(318,829.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"Tell me how to reach—"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:16.31,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,247.5)\blur1.5\c&H4F4F4F&\frz13.55}You have a new message
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:17.44,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr12.9\fs82.5\blur4.5\pos(581.833,436.666)}John Titor \N\N\N\N\N\N\NAre you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.77,0:06:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Regarding the image you sent of that program,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.91,0:06:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it is indeed a proprietary programming language developed by IBN,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.16,0:06:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and decoding it will require an IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.29,0:06:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Future Gadget Laboratory
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,will now initiate an emergency secret plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Daru!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to engage in battle with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,an immense organization that controls the world from the shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's SERN!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a worldwide organization
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.65,0:07:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,obsessed with dark science, and they're plotting a huge conspiracy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The world only needs one mad scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We must complete our quest before they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we need an IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll decode SERN's mysterious program.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mayushii has her part-time job today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.39,0:07:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So I get to do it alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:42.94,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\c&H717171&\fs50\frz24.12\pos(318.501,549.834)}Name            :  {\c&HF1F1F1&}Shining Finger
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:42.94,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr24\blur3\fs50\c&HAAB0B2&\pos(324.832,702)}Subject     :  {\c&HF1F1F1&}Sorry if I'm bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:42.94,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr24\blur3\c&HF1F1F1&\pos(390.666,845.501)}Are you mad? Sorry if I'm bothering you. \N\N\N\NI really need the IBN 5100 information, \N\N\Nand right now, you're the only one I can ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be worth exchanging information.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You destroyed the jacket's shoulder...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.46,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\i1\be5\fr-6\fs49.5\c&HE4E4E4&\pos(525.167,547.833)\fax0.15}Let's both do our best \NI don't have any real information.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.46,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\i1\be5\fr-5\fs49.5\c&HE4E4E4&\pos(469.5,723.832)\fax0.15}How about you{\c&H0F1EC8&}?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.46,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\i1\be5\fr-6\fs49.5\c&HE4E4E4&\pos(1092.169,742.833)\fax0.15}Moeka
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"I don't have any real information."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you glaring at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.35,0:08:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather you didn't blame me for your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sulking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri was worried that you might've gotten upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too old to act like a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the last person I want to hear that from.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what did you want to talk to me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.15,0:08:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop sulking, come back to the lab, and work, Christina.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to at least stick to calling me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to people when they're talking, "The Zombie"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of us isn't listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd I get involved with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to punch myself for giving in to my curiosity back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.97,0:08:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those messages that annoying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you wouldn't believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she also an Organization agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:08:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the Organization?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:08:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization is the Organization!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an international secret organization,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,controlling the world from the shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just a conspiracy theory, thank you very—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.49,0:09:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.53,0:09:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Any more questions, and I'll hit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaming others for your problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.21,0:09:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,After we recover the laundry, I'll give you your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think I'd follow you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.59,0:09:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Laundry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't one at the hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's a pretty nice hotel....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's not my style to send everything I wear to the cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You found it, thanks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be gratef—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No change?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think something'll happen when it spins, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer lies in the components we find most natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would expect that hooking a cell phone to a microwave
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.45,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,would make a time machine—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a time machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That was some kind of mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Time machines only exist in science fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have no part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you try so hard to deny what you saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be some kind of past trauma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it happened when she was five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Christina was struck by lightning on the grassy plains of Arkansas...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.98,0:10:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's theoretically impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Theories are nothing more than words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept what you've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so stub{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,to make the same mistake my father made!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I got emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I deliberately provoked you to see what you'd do—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the PhoneWave isn't a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I forced you to join the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to come anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll tell you this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else will ever have the title of Lab Mem 004.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That number will be yours forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a great parting speech!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.55,0:11:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what bugs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.18,0:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have your laundry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You should reflect on your thoughtless actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't grab me there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:11:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,IBN?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.11,0:12:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an old PC.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to use it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.71,0:12:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The IBN 5100 is connected to SERN's secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.93,0:12:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN is researching time travel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and to decode their secret program,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we need the IBN 5100's special functionality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You... You snorted!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.99,0:12:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you. Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So just you wait! Christina!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no "-tina"...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN is researching time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We need the IBN 5100's special functionality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez... I told her because she said she wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A PC?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:12:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. An old PC...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, it costs 5,100 yen or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,5,100... Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Mayushii heard something amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:17.57,KeitaiKinshiOrSmth,,0,0,0,,{\be30\t(\be0)}{\pos(432,226.5)\bord0}No Cell Phones
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No cell phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:18.24,KeitaiKinshiOrSmth,,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,226.5)\bord0}No Cell Phones
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris said she's seen the PC you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:18.86,KeitaiKinshiOrSmth,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\move(432,226.5,813.333,23.667,0,630)}No Cell Phones
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No cell phones!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.37,0:13:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.79,0:13:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.55,0:13:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris NyanNyan! Faris NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.05,0:13:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris NyanNyan! Faris NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.39,0:13:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.98,0:13:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's yours truly! Nyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.85,0:13:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're starting the Faris Cup daytime group!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, do your best to beat Faris
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:14:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and win a special NyanNyan Omelet Rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris NyanNyan! Faris NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here? Some kind of space-time distortion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's the Faris Cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris is going to play Rai-Net Access Battlers with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.18,0:14:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to participate too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris can play up to ten at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.27,0:14:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's still...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, the IBN 5100!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.15,0:14:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.03,0:14:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you if you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the planet's power structure depends on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Some stupid game—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't play, then I'm sorry, but you'll have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a maid, and you're having your master leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.83,0:14:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The IBN 5100...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm not listening!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'll have to go all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, can you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris is one of the country's best players.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I win?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be asking Faris that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan that's never failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan Code:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,G-B-A-C-K.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I call it G-Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds pretty amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You say that now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but when this plan explodes, you might not survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.09,0:15:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're serious, aren't you, Kyouma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this clear:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If I participate, you'll tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.85,0:15:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The cat ears never lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1000)}...that there are some opponents you just can't beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.11,0:16:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii's disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What was your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But his constant charging and self-destructing basically screamed, "Get back."{Original: But he just kept charging me, like he was self-destructing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,G-back?{Original: Jibaku?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Back... Get Back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a horrible joke, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}However!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you know, Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He recovers quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're arrogant for a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.63,0:16:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I said if I participated, you'd tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, I never cared about winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my brilliant plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant or cheating, one of the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.86,0:16:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.24,0:16:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure when I was little, Dad had one, but it's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.95,0:16:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the secret move
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:17:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you mastered in the Guiana Highlands, the Question-Dodge?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw through my Cold Shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.89,0:17:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.10,0:17:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure the last time I saw it was at an Akihabara shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.48,0:17:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.31,0:17:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kurisu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for messaging us all the way from Japan."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,"I asked the professor about your question,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and he said that, yes, the IBN 5100
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,can analyze certain special programming languages."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.95,0:17:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He was serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to ask my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.59,0:17:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,An IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't know what that is, tell him it's an old computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.84,0:17:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.93,0:17:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,End with the code words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.76,0:17:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,E-El... Psy Kongri...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kongroo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Makise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.53,0:18:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't remember a Makise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd we meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Paris? London?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Akihabara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I just saw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What? It's my assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.16,0:18:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say "Christina"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no "-tina"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as loud and bossy as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.67,0:18:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose fault is that? Whose?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.55,0:18:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.17,0:18:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading to Yanabayashi Shrine...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Harassment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that harassment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that call about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I just asked where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No one called you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No one called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.53,0:18:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he said that we have that PC here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,PC?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean an IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the IBN—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.59,0:19:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of introduction was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not your assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't even take ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pain, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.77,0:19:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu, my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.81,0:19:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'm your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Urushibara Luka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.57,0:19:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventeen this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,One year younger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a grownup, Makise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Not nearly as pretty as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... I'll call my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.84,0:19:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better not to know some things, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought it would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well, the person who donated this told us...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,that someday, a young man who needed it would appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.82,0:20:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It was ten years ago, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.11,0:20:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.24,0:20:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The choice of Steins Gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.16,0:20:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.87,0:20:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,IBN 5100 Portable Computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, could we borrow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.05,0:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.35,0:20:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're carrying this back! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.43,0:20:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my assistant, Christina!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your assistant, and there's no "-tina"!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get a cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't ask you for that, after you lent this to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.98,0:20:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some respect for others!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You really just said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.82,0:21:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are good friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Be nice to Luka too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a nice father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.46,0:21:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to make the same mistake my father made!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The cart's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to do this with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.15,0:21:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and carry it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.49,0:21:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.25,0:21:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with your provocations?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you carry it like that, I'll have to walk backward!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Start walking, assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:21:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:22:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do this walking backward!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.59,0:22:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.09,0:22:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the words of support, but no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest we walk sideways!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.68,0:22:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we need to!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to trip!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.11,0:22:30.16,EDRom,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8\fad(250,1500)}kisei sareta shikai mujihi naru
